# Plans become OpenSpec

Do not implement from a Cursor plan, Plan-mode doc, or `.cursor/plans/*.md` until it exists as an OpenSpec change under `openspec/changes/<id>/` (proposal, design, tasks, delta specs). Convert with `/plan-to-openspec`. Then implement with `/opsx-apply` or `/multitask` against those specs.

```
# ❌ BAD — edit product code from the plan file only
Implement @.cursor/plans/resolve-dispute.md

# ✅ GOOD — OpenSpec change first
/plan-to-openspec @.cursor/plans/resolve-dispute.md
# artifacts: openspec/changes/resolve-dispute/
/multitask @.cursor/plans/resolve-dispute.md
```

Example already converted: `.cursor/plans/resolve-dispute.md` → `openspec/changes/resolve-dispute/`.

201 Fieldnote issues: treat `FIELD_DEMO_ISSUES` in `lib/runbooks/linear-field-demos.ts` as the plan source (no Linear MCP). One OpenSpec change per issue. Do not archive unless asked.
